# ADNOC AR Marker Pattern File
#
# THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER FILE
#
# To use this application with the ADNOC logo marker, you need to:
#
# 1. Visit: https://www.adnoc.ae
# 2. Download the ADNOC logo
# 3. Generate a custom marker pattern using:
#    https://ar-js-org.github.io/AR.js/three.js/examples/marker-training/examples/generator.html
# 4. Replace this file with your generated .patt file
# 5. Name it: adnoc-marker.patt
#
# For detailed instructions, see: ADNOC-MARKER-SETUP.md
#
# The generated .patt file will contain a matrix of numbers that AR.js uses
# to recognize and track the ADNOC logo marker.
#
# File format: Plain text with numerical pattern data
# Expected size: ~1-2 KB
#
